                    coach_default:          `Decision logged.`,
                    coach_r1_internal:      `<strong>That’s the diagnosis Kang’s chain points to.</strong> The gap originates upstream: branch staff wait 4.2 days for IT and 6 for credit against a 1-day standard. External service quality is produced by internal service quality — fix the back office and the front line can finally keep the promise.`,
