                    coach_r2_orientation:   `<strong>That is internal marketing orientation.</strong> A resourced, realistic SLA, an empowered front line, and a culture that treats colleagues as internal customers — recognition and shared scorecards, not just a mandate. Engagement climbs now; the satisfaction lift lands next quarter as the chain works through.`,
                    coach_r2_mandate:       `<strong>You mandated a 1-day SLA with no capacity and no recognition.</strong> SLAs without internal marketing are just new targets to miss — in a quarter IT resents the front line more, not less. What makes a department <em>want</em> to serve its colleagues?`,
